Looking at the crossings: the curve starting at E heads down‑right, crossing the dashed A–F curve near (180, 468) and later crossing the straight C–D line near (620, 568). Keeping on the same smooth (sagging) curve through both crossings, it continues to the endpoint at the lower right.

Tracing: E → (crossing with dashed curve) → (crossing with C–D line) → B.

